# Graphify intermediates — committed artifacts (graph.json, GRAPH_REPORT.md,
# .graphify_labels.json) are explicitly NOT ignored; see GRAPH_SPEC §1.
# NOTE (QKG_018 F7): patterns with a slash are root-anchored, so every graphify
# intermediate also needs a **/ variant to match knowledge_graphs/<lib>/.graphify/.
.graphify/.graphify_detect.json
.graphify/.graphify_extract.json
.graphify/.graphify_analysis.json
.graphify/.graphify_ast.json
.graphify/.graphify_semantic.json
